SLAM prediction: report stale poses as untracked, ignore accelerometer noise.

When the SLAM system stops producing poses, prediction extrapolated from
the last one without bound (on the PICO 4: the view kept rotating). Poses
requested more than 500 ms after the newest SLAM pose are now untracked,
so the device driver can fall back to its own tracking.

SLAM_PRED_ACCEL_GYRO adds the mean acceleration since the newest SLAM pose to
its velocity. At rest that is bias and gravity residue, and the time it is
scaled by saws with every SLAM pose, so a still view shimmered. Accelerations
are now shrunk by SLAM_ACCEL_DEADBAND (default 0.3 m/s^2), continuously.

--- a/src/xrt/auxiliary/tracking/t_tracker_slam.cpp
+++ b/src/xrt/auxiliary/tracking/t_tracker_slam.cpp
@@ -86,6 +86,7 @@
 DEBUG_GET_ONCE_BOOL_OPTION(slam_submit_from_start, "SLAM_SUBMIT_FROM_START", false)
 DEBUG_GET_ONCE_NUM_OPTION(slam_openvr_groundtruth_device, "SLAM_OPENVR_GROUNDTRUTH_DEVICE", 0)
 DEBUG_GET_ONCE_NUM_OPTION(slam_prediction_type, "SLAM_PREDICTION_TYPE", long(SLAM_PRED_DEAD_RECKONING))
+DEBUG_GET_ONCE_FLOAT_OPTION(slam_accel_deadband, "SLAM_ACCEL_DEADBAND", 0.3f)
 DEBUG_GET_ONCE_BOOL_OPTION(slam_write_csvs, "SLAM_WRITE_CSVS", false)
 DEBUG_GET_ONCE_OPTION(slam_csv_path, "SLAM_CSV_PATH", "evaluation/")
 DEBUG_GET_ONCE_BOOL_OPTION(slam_timing_stat, "SLAM_TIMING_STAT", true)
@@ -831,6 +832,13 @@
 		return;
 	}
 
+	// A SLAM pose this old means the tracker has stopped producing poses; predicting
+	// from it runs away without bound. Report the pose as untracked instead.
+	if (when_ns - (int64_t)rel_ts > 500 * 1000 * 1000) {
+		out_relation->relation_flags = XRT_SPACE_RELATION_BITMASK_NONE;
+		return;
+	}
+
 	// Use only last SLAM pose without prediction if PREDICTION_NONE
 	if (t.pred_type == SLAM_PRED_NONE) {
 		*out_relation = rel;
@@ -877,6 +885,11 @@
 		xrt_vec3 world_accel{};
 		math_quat_rotate_vec3(&rel.pose.orientation, &avg_accel, &world_accel);
 		world_accel += t.gravity_correction;
+		// At rest the mean acceleration is bias and gravity residue, scaled below by a time
+		// that saws with every SLAM pose: a still view shimmered. Shrink it softly.
+		float accel = m_vec3_len(world_accel);
+		float deadband = debug_get_float_option_slam_accel_deadband();
+		world_accel = accel > deadband ? world_accel * ((accel - deadband) / accel) : xrt_vec3{0, 0, 0};
 		double slam_to_imu_dt = time_ns_to_s(t.last_imu_ts - rel_ts);
 		rel.linear_velocity += world_accel * slam_to_imu_dt;
 	}
